// Signing for VibeMeeting.
//
// macOS ties privacy permissions (System Audio Recording, Microphone) to the
// app's signature. Without a Team, Xcode signs ad hoc ("Sign to Run Locally"),
// every rebuild gets a new identity, and system audio can arrive as pure
// silence even though the permission toggle looks on.
//
// Your Team lives in Configs/Local.xcconfig (not committed), so it survives
// `xcodegen generate`. Create it with scripts/save-signing-team.sh.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
